{
 "about": "Test sheets for Lantern's Sheet Music Reader (1.21.0), engraved with Verovio 6.4 from the ABC and Humdrum below and rasterised in Chromium at 1300, 900 and 700 pixels wide (staff lines about 11, 7 and 5.5 pixels apart). Tunes: public domain (Beethoven's Ode to Joy, Twinkle Twinkle, Frere Jacques) or written for these tests; all CC0. bars: each bar's notes as [midi or null for a rest, length in quarter notes]. 1.21.1: the piano sheets' chords (from the left hand) and ode_title_900.png's heading (the same Ode with its title and composer printed above). Remake with make_sheets.py (needs verovio and playwright).",
 "sources": {
  "ode_c": "X:1\nT:Ode to Joy\nM:4/4\nL:1/4\nK:C\nE E F G | G F E D | C C D E | E3/2 D/2 D2 | E E F G | G F E D | C C D E | D3/2 C/2 C2 |\nD D E C | D E/F/ E C | D E/F/ E D | C D G,2 | E E F G | G F E D | C C D E | D3/2 C/2 C2 |]\n",
  "ode_rests": "X:1\nT:Ode to Joy (simple)\nM:4/4\nL:1/4\nK:C\nE E F G | G F E D | C C D E | E3/2 D/2 D z | E E F G | G F E D | C C D E | D3/2 C/2 C z |\nD D E C | D E/F/ E C | D E/F/ E D | C D z2 |]\n",
  "twinkle_g": "X:1\nT:Twinkle\nM:4/4\nL:1/4\nK:G\nG G d d | e e d2 | c c B B | A A G2 | d d c c | B B A2 | d d c c | B B A2 |\nG G d d | e e d2 | c c B B | A A G2 |]\n",
  "waltz_f": "X:1\nT:A small waltz\nM:3/4\nL:1/4\nK:F\nA2 c | B2 G | A3 | F z F | G A B | c2 A | G3 | F2 z |]\n",
  "frere_d": "X:1\nT:Frere Jacques\nM:4/4\nL:1/4\nK:D\nD E F D | D E F D | F G A2 | F G A2 | A/B/A/G/ F D | A/B/A/G/ F D | D A, D2 | D A, D2 |]\n",
  "minor_a": "X:1\nT:In A minor\nM:4/4\nL:1/4\nK:Am\nA B c d | e2 e2 | f e d c | B4 | ^G A B c | B A ^G B | A4 |]\n",
  "bflat_rests": "X:1\nT:Evening\nM:4/4\nL:1/4\nK:Bb\nB c d2 | f3/2 e/2 d z | c d e c | d4 | z4 | B c d B | c B A c | B2 z2 |]\n"
 },
